{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["occ"],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"@interface"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNMapSnapshotter"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"NSObject","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSObject"}]}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/StaticSnapshotExample"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"You can change the snapshotter’s options at any time and reuse the snapshotter","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"for multiple distinct snapshots; however, the snapshotter can only generate one","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"snapshot at a time. If you need to generate multiple snapshots concurrently,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"create multiple snapshotter objects.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"For an interactive map, use the ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapView","isActive":true},{"text":" class. Both ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapSnapshotter","isActive":true},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapView","isActive":true},{"text":" are compatible with offline packs managed by the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflineStorage","isActive":true},{"text":" class.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"From a snapshot, you can obtain an image and convert geographic coordinates to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the image’s coordinate space in order to superimpose markers and overlays. If","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"you do not need offline map functionality, you can use the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Snapshot"},{"type":"text","text":" class in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/mapbox\/MapboxStatic.swift\/","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" to generate"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"static map images with overlays."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Example","text":"Example"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let camera = MLNMapCamera(lookingAtCenter: CLLocationCoordinate2D(latitude: 37.7184, longitude:","-122.4365), altitude: 100, pitch: 20, heading: 0)","","let options = MLNMapSnapshotOptions(styleURL: MLNStyle.satelliteStreetsStyleURL, camera: camera,","size: CGSize(width: 320, height: 480)) options.zoomLevel = 10","","let snapshotter = MLNMapSnapshotter(options: options)","snapshotter.start { (snapshot, error) in","    if let error = error {","        fatalError(error.localizedDescription)","    }","","    image = snapshot?.image","}"]},{"type":"heading","level":4,"anchor":"Related-examples","text":"Related examples"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"TODO: Create a static map snapshot, learn how to use the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapSnapshotter","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" to generate a static image based on an ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapSnapshotter","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"object’s style, camera, and view bounds.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/Ma